{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04667","headline":"岳州别赵国公王十一琚入朝 · 张说","name":"岳州别赵国公王十一琚入朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔滥貂蝉长，同承雨露霏。\n今参鱼鳖守，望美洞庭归。\n浦树悬秋影，江云烧落辉。\n离魂似征帆，恒往帝乡飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}